in=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,12,7)\">Lev 12:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 12:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,12,8)\">Lev 12:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:20\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,20)\">Lev 14:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); by the ceremony of the two birds <ref ref=\"Lev 14:53\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"53\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"53\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,53)\">Lev 14:53</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); by ashes of red heifer <ref ref=\"Num 19:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,19,12)\">Num 19:12</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>be clean morally</highlight>, of people, made clean by <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s scattering clean water upon them <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,25)\">Ezek 36:25</ref> of Jerusalem, specifically made clean from idolatry, under figure of adultery <ref ref=\"Jer 13:27\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,27)\">Jer 13:27</ref> also followed by <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 24:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,24,13)\">Ezek 24:13</ref> (twice in verse) (purification by <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>); <highlight>made clean</highlight> <bdbheb>מִכָּלחַֿטּאֹתֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:30\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,30)\">Lev 16:30</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; by the sin-offering of the atonement day); also of the individual, <highlight>be clean</highlight> <bdbheb>מֵחַטָּאוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 20:9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,9)\">Prov 20:9</ref> (|| <bdbheb>זכה</bdbheb>); <highlight>become clean</highlight> by use of hyssop <ref ref=\"Ps 51:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,9)\">Ps 51:9</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אַלְבִּין</bdbheb>); more generally <bdbheb>אִםמֵֿעשֵֹׁהוּ יִטְהַרגָּֿ֑בֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 4:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,17)\">Job 4:17</ref> <highlight>shall a man be more pure than his maker</highlight>? (|| <bdbheb>יִצְדָּ֑ק</bdbheb>). <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>טִהַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 13:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,3)\">Lev 13:3</ref> + 4 t.; suffix <bdbheb>טִהֲרוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 13:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,6)\">Lev 13:6</ref> + 5 t.; 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>טִהַרְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 8:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,6)\">Num 8:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 8:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,15)\">Num 8:15</ref> etc. + 7 t. <highlight>Perfect; Imperfect</highlight>; <bdbheb>יְטַהֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,5)\">2Chr 34:5</ref> etc. + 4 t. <highlight>Imperfect; Imperative</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>טַהֲרֵנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 51:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,4)\">Ps 51:4</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>טַהֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,12)\">Ezek 39:12</ref> + 5 t.; suffix <bdbheb>טַהֲרִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:33\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,33)\">Ezek 36:33</ref> etc. + 4 t. <highlight>Infinitive; Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְטַחֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 14:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,11)\">Lev 14:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 3:3\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,3)\">Mal 3:3</ref> — chiefly <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>cleanse, purify:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>physically</highlight>, metals from dross <ref ref=\"Mal 3:3\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,3)\">Mal 3:3</ref> land from corpses <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,12)\">Ezek 39:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,14)\">Ezek 39:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,16)\">Ezek 39:16</ref> heavens from clouds <ref ref=\"Job 37:21\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,21)\">Job 37:21</ref> temple from unclean things <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,15)\">2Chr 29:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,16)\">2Chr 29:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 29:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,29,18)\">2Chr 29:18</ref> land and city from Asherim and images <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,3)\">2Chr 34:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,5)\">2Chr 34:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 34:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,34,8)\">2Chr 34:8</ref> store-chambers of temple from household stuff <ref ref=\"Neh 13:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,9)\">Neh 13:9</ref> priesthood by exclusion of alien blood <ref ref=\"Neh 13:30\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,30)\">Neh 13:30</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>ceremonially</highlight>, the altar of incense by the blood of the annual sin-offering <ref ref=\"Lev 16:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,19)\">Lev 16:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); the people, gates, and wall (by some undefined ceremony) <ref ref=\"Neh 12:30\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,30)\">Neh 12:30</ref> the altar of the court by the blood of sin-offerings <ref ref=\"Ezek 43:26\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(26,43,26)\">Ezek 43:26</ref> of consecration of Levites by <bdbheb>מֵי חטאת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 8:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,6)\">Num 8:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 8:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,7)\">Num 8:7</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), and <bdbheb>חטאת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 8:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,15)\">Num 8:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 8:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,21)\">Num 8:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>morally</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:30\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,30)\">Lev 16:30</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 37:23\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(26,37,23)\">Ezek 37:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 3:3\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,3)\">Mal 3:3</ref> <bdbheb>מֵחַטָּאֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 51:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,4)\">Ps 51:4</ref> <bdbheb>מֵעונ(ותׅ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 33:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,8)\">Jer 33:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:33\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,33)\">Ezek 36:33</ref> <bdbheb>מִטּמא(ו)ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 24:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,24,13)\">Ezek 24:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,25)\">Ezek 36:25</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>pronounce clean</highlight>, ceremonially <ref ref=\"Lev 13:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,6)\">Lev 13:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 13:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,13)\">Lev 13:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 13:17\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,17)\">Lev 13:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 13:23\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,23)\">Lev 13:23</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Lev 12:28\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(3,12,28)\">Lev 12:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 13:34\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,34)\">Lev 13:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 13:37\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,37)\">Lev 13:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 13:59\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"59\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"59\" onclick=\"bcv(3,13,59)\">Lev 13:59</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,7)\">Lev 14:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:48\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,48)\">Lev 14:48</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>perform the ceremony of cleansing</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 14:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,11)\">Lev 14:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>טֹהַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 20:26\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(9,20,26)\">1Sam 20:26</ref> (so. read for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>טהור</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>, he is not clean, because <highlight>he hath not been cleansed</highlight>); <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ לֹא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מְטֹהָרָה</bdbheb> <highlight>a land not cleansed</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,24)\">Ezek 22:24</ref> (but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SS')\">SS</lookup> read <highlight>a land not rained upon</highlight>, see  <bdbheb><reflink>מטר</reflink></bdbheb>). <b>Hithpa`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 plural <bdbheb>הִטָּֽהֲרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:20\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,20)\">Ezra 6:20</ref> <bdbheb>הִטֶּהָ֑רוּ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>i. 271</sup></lookup>) <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,18)\">2Chr 30:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 8:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,7)\">Num 8:7</ref> 1 plural <bdbheb>הִטַּהַרְנוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 22:17\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,17)\">Josh 22:17</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִטָּֽהֲרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 12:30\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,30)\">Neh 12:30</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>הִטָּֽהֲרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 35:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,2)\">Gen 35:2</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מִטַּהֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 14:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,7)\">Lev 14:7</ref> + 11 t.; <highlight>plural</highlight> <bdbheb>מִטַּהֲרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 13:22\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,22)\">Neh 13:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 66:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,17)\">Isa 66:17</ref> — reflexive: </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>purify oneself:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> ceremonially, especially in preparation for sacred duties <ref ref=\"Gen 35:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,2)\">Gen 35:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('R')\"><reflink>R</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Num 8:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,7)\">Num 8:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 30:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,30,18)\">2Chr 30:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 6:20\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(15,6,20)\">Ezra 6:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 13:22\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,22)\">Neh 13:22</ref> also for heathen mysteries <ref ref=\"Isa 66:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,17)\">Isa 66:17</ref> of purifying priests, people, and wall <ref ref=\"Neh 12:30\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(16,12,30)\">Neh 12:30</ref> (compare <b>Pi`el 1 b</b>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> morally <ref ref=\"Josh 22:17\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,17)\">Josh 22:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>present oneself for purification</highlight>, only participle <bdbheb>הַמִּטַּהֵר</bdbheb> <highlight>the candidate for purification</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 14:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,4)\">Lev 14:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,7)\">Lev 14:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,8)\">Lev 14:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,11)\">Lev 14:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,14)\">Lev 14:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:17\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,17)\">Lev 14:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:18\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,18)\">Lev 14:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"19\" cEn